[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "ほう？　ヤンネに休暇を楽しんでもらいたいんだな",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "はいっす。\nでも、どうしたらいいかなーって悩んでて……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "はっはっは！！　簡単なことではないか。\nそれなら余と千歳が手を貸そう！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "localized_name": "千歳",
    "romanized_name": "Chitose",
    "model_path_hash": 3924733721061764343,
    "text": "ケイウンには「おもてなし」の文化がございます。\nもしかしたら、皆様のお役に立てるかと……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4561510886967726962,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "それは心強い。けど、いいの？\n二人も行楽に来ているんじゃ……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "よいよい。お前たちには借りがあるからな。\nそれに、楽しそうではないか！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "誰かを喜ばすために動くのは大好きだ！\nこれも１つの良き休暇の過ごし方だな",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "これも休暇……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "鏑矢さんも千歳も、ありがとう！\nそれじゃ、お言葉に甘えて！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "うむ、このへんが良さそうだ。\nここで場を整えよう",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "localized_name": "千歳",
    "romanized_name": "Chitose",
    "model_path_hash": 3924733721061764343,
    "text": "必要なものは島で貸し出しているみたいです。\n借りてきましょう",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4561510886967726962,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "よいしょっと……こんな感じ？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "うん、いい感じじゃん？\n海辺の休息といえば、ずばりコレ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "コレ、とは？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "水着でのーんびり、寝転がってくつろぐんだよ。\nここに冷たい飲み物も用意すれば完璧だね！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "でも、場だけ整えてもどうするの？\nヤンネさんをここに呼べばいい？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "ああ。こんな素敵な場所を用意されたら、\nくつろがないわけにもいくまい！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "……強引な理論",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "localized_name": "千歳",
    "romanized_name": "Chitose",
    "model_path_hash": 3924733721061764343,
    "text": "ふふ。そうですね。\nでも、ヤンネ様はお優しい方ですから……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4561510886967726962,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "うん。一緒に楽しんでほしいって\nアタシたちの気持ち、きっと分かってくれるはず！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "じゃあ、早速ヤンネさんを呼びに――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "待て",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "今のままでも、もてなしには十分だと思うが……\nうーむ、もう１つ何か欲しいな",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "冷たーい飲み物なら、用意するっすよ？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "いや、そうではない。\n……千歳！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "localized_name": "千歳",
    "romanized_name": "Chitose",
    "model_path_hash": 3924733721061764343,
    "text": "は、はい！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4561510886967726962,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "ひとつ、舞ってみてくれぬか",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "localized_name": "千歳",
    "romanized_name": "Chitose",
    "model_path_hash": 3924733721061764343,
    "text": "ど、どうでしょうか……？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4561510886967726962,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "愛い……愛いぞ！\nこれこそ、最高のもてなしではないか！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "おもてなし関係なく、鏑矢さんが見たいだけじゃ……\nでもこれは確かに、心惹かれるものがありますなぁ～",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "姉様姉様、私だって踊れるわ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "お？　なになに～……",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "この踊り、姉様に捧げる……！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "お、おお……？\nベップ、それは？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "おお！　なんだその面妖な踊りは！！\n初めて見たぞ！　余にも教えてくれ！！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "ええ、もちろん。\nコツは、腰を落として力強く、よ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "ヤドも一緒にどう？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "わ、私は――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "localized_name": "ベップ/鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "はっ！　はっ！　はーっ！！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 0,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "localized_name": "千歳",
    "romanized_name": "Chitose",
    "model_path_hash": 3924733721061764343,
    "text": "ふふっ……！　鏑矢様、さすがのキレです。\nベップ様とヤドヴィガ様も、素敵です",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4561510886967726962,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "これを見せられたヤンネさんは、\nいったいどうしろと……？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "わっ！　な、なに！？　今の声！？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "localized_name": "ヤドヴィガ",
    "romanized_name": "Jadwiga",
    "model_path_hash": 2111970354351478659,
    "text": "っ……！　この気配は……！！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 6170794110252514656,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  }
]